---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Services from '../components/Services.astro';
import Clients from '../components/Clients.astro';
import Gallery from '../components/Gallery.astro';
import Sectors from '../components/Sectors.astro';
import Team from '../components/Team.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.jsx';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { ArrowUpRight, Phone, Mail, MapPin, MessageCircle } from 'lucide-react';
import { business, phoneHref } from '../config';
---
<Layout><div id="inicio"></div><Header/><main id="contenido"><span id="content"></span><Hero/><Services/><Clients/><Gallery/><Sectors/><Team/>
<section class="quote-strip"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">INSTALACIONES ELÉCTRICAS Y ELECTRÓNICAS</p><h2>Tu próximo proyecto<br />empieza con una conversación.</h2></div><a class="button white" href={business.whatsapp}>Escríbenos por WhatsApp <ArrowUpRight size={19}/></a></div></section>
<section id="contacto" class="section contact-section"><div class="container contact-grid"><div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">05 / CONTACTO</p><h2>Cuéntanos<br /><span class="muted">qué necesitas.</span></h2><p>Elige cómo prefieres ponerte en contacto.<br />Estamos para ayudarte con tu instalación.</p><div class="contact-links"><a href={phoneHref}><span class="contact-icon"><Phone size={20}/></span><span>LLÁMANOS<strong>{business.phone}</strong></span><ArrowUpRight size={18}/></a><a href={business.whatsapp}><span class="contact-icon"><MessageCircle size={20}/></span><span>WHATSAPP<strong>Solicitar una cotización</strong></span><ArrowUpRight size={18}/></a><a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}><span class="contact-icon"><Mail size={20}/></span><span>ESCRÍBENOS<strong>{business.email}</strong></span><ArrowUpRight size={18}/></a><a href={`mailto:${business.secondaryEmail}`} class="secondary-email">{business.secondaryEmail} <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></a><div><span class="contact-icon"><MapPin size={20}/></span><span>ENCUÉNTRANOS<strong>{business.location}</strong></span></div></div></div><ContactForm client:visible={{rootMargin:"400px"}}/><noscript><p class="form-fallback">Activa JavaScript para usar el formulario o escríbenos a <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.</p></noscript></div></section>
</main><Footer/></Layout>
